        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Katie Sagona\n- Roles: child actor, child actress, former child actor\n- Concepts: definition of child actor\n\nFacts:\n- Katie Sagona was born on November 26, 1989.\n- Katie Sagona is an American child actress.\n- A child actor or child actress is generally a child who acts on stage, in motion pictures, or on television.\n- The term child actor or child actress can also refer to an adult who began an acting career as a child.\n- An adult who began acting as a child is also called a former child actor to avoid confusion.",
